e 4 and Newark Door 14. It was marked closed on Jul 1 but described as open again on Sep 30. I can't tell from these sources whether that is one ticket that was reopened or a number reused. Gideon or support can confirm.\n• The Aug 3 and 2026-05-03 digests, the Mar 2025 digest and the Jul 2025 digest cover Vantorre Group, but none gives a ticket number, so I haven't listed them. The Mar 2025 one only mentions an email from Mateo. The cheat sheet has no tickets.\n• I only searched the three sources you named. Tickets that only exist in support or CRM files aren't covered.","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127","thread_ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
